### StockSense Auth & RBAC API Flow (REST Client / Postman compatible)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2. User Signup
# @name signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "operator.test@stocksense.dev",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "WAREHOUSE_STAFF"
}

### 3. Login as Inventory Manager (Seeded user)
# @name loginManager
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "manager@stocksense.dev",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store Manager Token
@managerToken = {{loginManager.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Login as Warehouse Staff (Seeded user)
# @name loginStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "staff@stocksense.dev",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Store Staff Token
@staffToken = {{loginStaff.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Rotate Refresh Token (Rotation Flow)
# Note: In browser/Postman, refreshToken cookie is sent automatically.
# Fallback body provides testability in CLI tools.
# @name refreshToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}

### 6. Reuse Detection Test (Replaying an Old / Revoked Refresh Token)
# Submitting an old refresh token returns HTTP 401 and invalidates the session family
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": "already-rotated-or-revoked-token"
}

### 7. Request Password Reset OTP (Rate-limited endpoint)
# Check backend console output for simulated email containing the 6-digit OTP code
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "operator.test@stocksense.dev"
}

### 8. Verify OTP and Reset Password
# Replace OTP with the 6-digit code logged in dev console
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify-reset
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "operator.test@stocksense.dev",
  "otp": "123456",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword2026!"
}

### 9. Login with New Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "operator.test@stocksense.dev",
  "password": "NewSecurePassword2026!"
}

### 10. Get Current User Profile (@CurrentUser)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 11. RBAC Test: Manager accesses Manager-Only Route (Expect HTTP 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/placeholder/manager-only
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 12. RBAC Test: Warehouse Staff attempts Manager-Only Route (Expect HTTP 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/placeholder/manager-only
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 13. RBAC Test: Warehouse Staff accesses Staff-Permitted Route (Expect HTTP 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/placeholder/staff-accessible
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 14. List Users (Manager Only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 15. Logout (Revokes Refresh Token Family)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}
